{"task_id": "HumanEval/48", "solution": "def is_palindrome(text: str):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if given string is a palindrome using a two-pointer approach,\n    handling empty strings and performing case-insensitive comparison.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not text:\n        return True\n\n    # Normalize string to lowercase for case-insensitive comparison\n    normalized_text = text.lower()\n\n    left, right = 0, len(normalized_text) - 1\n\n    while left < right:\n        if normalized_text[left] != normalized_text[right]:\n            return False\n        left += 1\n        right -= 1\n\n    return True"}
