{"task_id": "HumanEval/55", "solution": "```python\ndef fib(n: int):\n    \"\"\"Return n-th Fibonacci number.\n    This function computes the Fibonacci number for a given positive integer n.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 1:\n        return n # Handles fib(0)=0 and fib(1)=1 based on standard sequence. Test cases ensure n>=1\n\n    a, b = 0, 1\n    # Loop n-1 times to reach the n-th number\n    # If n=1, loop 0 times, returns b (1)\n    # If n=2, loop 1 time, a,b becomes 1,1\n    for _ in range(n - 1):\n        a, b = b, a + b\n\n    return b\n```"}
