{"task_id": "HumanEval/57", "solution": "```python\ndef monotonic(l: list):\n    \"\"\"Return True is list elements are monotonically increasing or decreasing.\n    >>> monotonic([1, 2, 4, 20])\n    True\n    >>> monotonic([1, 20, 4, 10])\n    False\n    >>> monotonic([4, 1, 0, -10])\n    True\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(l) <= 1:\n        return True\n\n    # Check if the list is monotonically increasing\n    is_increasing = True\n    for i in range(1, len(l)):\n        if l[i] <= l[i-1]:\n            is_increasing = False\n            break\n\n    if is_increasing:\n        return True\n\n    # Check if the list is monotonically decreasing\n    is_decreasing = True\n    for i in range(1, len(l)):\n        if l[i] >= l[i-1]:\n            is_decreasing = False\n            break\n\n    return is_decreasing\n```"}
