{"task_id": "HumanEval/84", "solution": "```python\ndef solve(N):\n    \"\"\"Given a positive integer N, return the total sum of its digits in binary.\"\"\"\n\n    def _calculate_digit_sum(num):\n        \"\"\"Calculates the sum of all digits in a non-negative integer.\"\"\"\n        digit_sum = 0\n        while num > 0:\n            digit_sum += num % 10\n            num //= 10\n        return digit_sum\n\n    def _convert_to_binary(decimal_num):\n        \"\"\"Converts a non-negative decimal integer to its binary string representation.\"\"\"\n        if decimal_num == 0:\n            return \"0\"\n\n        binary_string = \"\"\n        while decimal_num > 0:\n            remainder = decimal_num % 2\n            binary_string = str(remainder) + binary_string\n            decimal_num //= 2\n        return binary_string\n\n    digit_sum_result = _calculate_digit_sum(N)\n    binary_representation = _convert_to_binary(digit_sum_result)\n\n    return binary_representation\n```"}
